# Only src/, Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock and README.md (the crate documentation)
# are bind-mounted into the build stage; keep everything heavy or secret out
# of the build context anyway.
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/compose.y*ml
**/Dockerfile*
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.csr
target*/
vendor/
docs/
deploy/
